  "modification_guides": [
    {
      "question": "改技能播放速度/倍速要动哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "CWarCtrl.m_Speed 与 OnUpdate 的 m_SpeedFrame 累加循环：一帧内按 m_Speed 跑整数次 _OnUpdate。改帧间隔则改 StartTimer 的 timer.Timer(0.033, ...)。m_Speed<1 时会有帧不推进，改动需要实机验证。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "ew_cwarctrl"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "暂停/继续怎么做？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "两层：CWarCtrl.SetPause 是全容器暂停（OnUpdate/_OnUpdate 开头都早退）；CWarCtrl.SetSkillPause(skillID, pause) / CPlayCtrl.SetPause 只停单个技能。注意全局暂停时 m_SpeedFrame 也会停止累加。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "ew_cwarctrl",
          "ew_cplayctrl"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "技能播完在哪里回收、怎么接通知？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "回收路径：_OnUpdate 发现 ctrl.IsEnd()（或 OnUpdate 抛异常 → OnUpdateError）→ 进 delList → _removeSkill → Release + del + 通知 e_warinterface。通知名在候选里是损坏标识符 e_warinterface.}EillFinished，接通知要先确认真实函数名。另外 CPlayCtrl 本身是 slot 信号主体，可用 TriggerSignal 订阅。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "ew_cwarctrl",
          "ew_cplayctrl",
          "n5_prov"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "新增一种技能播放要动哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "用 CWarCtrl.PlaySkill(skillID, skillPath, attackInfo) 登记即可，它会新建 CPlayCtrl 并由命令管理器 LoadSkillData(skillPath, attackInfo) 加载；真正的命令内容在 e_warcmdmgr（entry 631）与 warcmd 子模块（entry 1612 的分派表）里。容器是单例，跨战斗复用前需要 ModuleReset()。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "ew_cwarctrl",
          "ew_cplayctrl",
          "ew_module"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
